<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συννο-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meditate, reflect upon</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀξ ἐμοῦ παλαίφατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					453
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				220c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				241c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				712d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				24.30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τί τις χρήσεται</span>
			<i>think</i> what one can do with it, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				835d
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐμαυτῷ τι συννοούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					634
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ion</u>
				644
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make plans</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα -οῦμεν ἐκπράξειν χερί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Patrocl.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>comprehend, understand</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				164a
			</span></i>, al.: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὰ μανθάνοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Epin.</u>
					976b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				74
			</span></i>: folld. by a relat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὅτι . .
				</span><i>understand</i> that . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				280b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1284a32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					238c
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				598
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>know at the same time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mich.
				<u>in EN</u>
				518.34
			</span></i>.</div>
